Posting CSV flattens costs, comments, tags, balances, and source locations.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight postings --format csv

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK ; Local currency
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND ; Traded fund
  format 1,000 FUND
tag Reviewed
account Assets:Cash ; Everyday "account"
account Assets:Fund
account Equity:Opening
P 2024-01-01 FUND 12 SEK ; Closing, official
2024-01-02 Buy fund ; imported
  ; Reviewed: manually
  Assets:Fund  1 FUND {10 SEK} ; broker
  Assets:Cash  -10 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

postingId,transactionId,transactionDate,description,transactionComments,transactionTags,postingDate,account,postingComments,postingTags,amountQuantity,amountCommodity,lotCostQuantity,lotCostCommodity,lotCostIsTotal,costQuantity,costCommodity,costIsTotal,balanceAssignmentQuantity,balanceAssignmentCommodity,balanceAssertionQuantity,balanceAssertionCommodity,resolvedQuantity,resolvedCommodity,resolvedBalance,filename,transactionSourceLine
1,8,2024-01-02,Buy fund,"[""imported""]","[{""name"":""Reviewed"",""value"":""manually""}]",2024-01-02,Assets:Fund,"[""broker""]",[],1,FUND,10,SEK,false,,,,,,,,1,FUND,1,{{JOURNAL_PATH}},11
2,8,2024-01-02,Buy fund,"[""imported""]","[{""name"":""Reviewed"",""value"":""manually""}]",2024-01-02,Assets:Cash,[],[],-10,SEK,,,,,,,,,,,-10,SEK,-10,{{JOURNAL_PATH}},11

========== WARNINGS ==========
